{
  "comment": [
    "Hand-maintained: the macOS input method path (SPEC §6, INTENT D9-macOS).",
    "The tracing agent only records what a run actually exercises, and collecting this",
    "requires composing Korean text by hand. Without it the image builds and renders,",
    "then aborts the moment an IME queries the focused text field: AWTView calls these",
    "methods through JNI, the lookup fails, and the resulting Objective-C exception",
    "terminates the process instead of surfacing a Java stack trace."
  ],
